FILE: examples/sketchpad/ (index.html, main.js, README.md)
FEATURE: sketch-pad-module
DATE: 2026-10-06
PRIOR STATE: did not exist

REASON
NEW FILES. The required runnable example for the new module, built on
examples/shared/example.css. Sections: a hero whiteboard seeded through
load() (shapes, text, pen, image, a straight and a curved connector bound
to shapes) with toolbar, actions and a setStyle() sidebar; 01 a live
control for every config property, with an equivalent-code panel and a
callback log (keyboardScope rebuilds the pad around the same scene); 02 the
scene as editable JSON with load({history:true}) and exportCanvas() PNG
preview; 03 the constrained pad over a CSS-drawn invitation card, the setup
My Invitees uses; 04 createStamp() on inline SVGs and mono retinting; 05 ten
bad calls printing the thrown errors. Offline, responsive to 390px.
